---
import InteriorLayout from "../layouts/InteriorLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
---

<InteriorLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | V12 Electric"
  description="Read the V12 Electric privacy policy for contact requests, phone inquiries, scheduling links, personal information, and use of this website."
  image="/images/hero-privacy-plans.webp"
  imageAlt="Tablet displaying an electrical power plan on a construction site table with blueprints and a hard hat"
  pageType="article"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: "Privacy Policy", path: "/privacy/" }]}
  showCta={false}
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Privacy"
    title="Your information, handled clearly."
    description="This policy explains what V12 Electric may receive when you contact the business through this website or a linked scheduling service."
    image="/images/hero-privacy-plans.webp"
    alt="Tablet displaying an electrical power plan on a construction site table with blueprints and a hard hat"
  />

  <article class="legal-page section-pad">
    <p class="legal-meta">Last reviewed: August 5, 2026</p>
    <h2>Information you choose to send</h2>
    <p>
      V12 Electric may receive your name, phone number, email address, city, property address,
      selected service, timing, project stage, and project details when you submit an inquiry or
      call the business. Only provide information needed to discuss the work.
    </p>

    <h2>How information is used</h2>
    <p>
      Information is used to respond to inquiries, understand the requested electrical work,
      schedule or coordinate service, communicate about a project, and maintain business records.
      V12 Electric does not publish inquiry details or use them for unrelated marketing without a
      separate basis or permission.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-party services</h2>
    <p>
      The site may link to a V12 Housecall Pro booking page. That provider may collect information
      under its own privacy policy. Phone, email, Google, Thumbtack, social, and other external
      links are also governed by the policies of the service you choose to use.
    </p>

    <h2>Retention and security</h2>
    <p>
      V12 Electric keeps inquiry information only as long as reasonably needed for communication,
      scheduling, project administration, legal obligations, or dispute resolution. No online
      service can guarantee absolute security, but reasonable care should be used when handling
      contact information.
    </p>

    <h2>California privacy requests</h2>
    <p>
      California residents may ask what personal information was provided, request correction or
      deletion where applicable, or ask about how it is used. Call V12 Electric at
      <a href="tel:+17605676593">(760) 567-6593</a> with a clear description of the request. V12
      may need to verify the request before responding.
    </p>

    <h2>Policy changes</h2>
    <p>
      This policy may be updated when the site, contact destinations, or data practices change.
      The effective date shown above identifies the latest review.
    </p>
  </article>
</InteriorLayout>
